msgstr "A verificação de spam ainda não terminou — espere um momento e tente de novo."

#: templates/admin/tasks.php:271 templates/public/signup.php:1606
msgid "The start time is required. Leave the end blank if it is not decided. An end earlier than the start is read as the next morning."
